"use strict";(self.webpackChunkageno_blog=self.webpackChunkageno_blog||[]).push([[1434],{4234(s,i,a){a.r(i),a.d(i,{comp:()=>l,data:()=>h});var e=a(641);const n={},l=(0,a(6262).A)(n,[["render",function(s,i){const a=(0,e.g2)("RouteLink");return(0,e.uX)(),(0,e.CE)("div",null,[i[7]||(i[7]=(0,e.Lk)("h1",{id:"c-c-socket-实战-同一服务切换-select、poll、epoll-配合抓包理解全过程",tabindex:"-1"},[(0,e.Lk)("a",{class:"header-anchor",href:"#c-c-socket-实战-同一服务切换-select、poll、epoll-配合抓包理解全过程"},[(0,e.Lk)("span",null,"C/C++ Socket 实战：同一服务切换 select、poll、epoll，配合抓包理解全过程")])],-1)),(0,e.Lk)("p",null,[i[3]||(i[3]=(0,e.eW)("前面三篇分别建立 ",-1)),(0,e.bF)(a,{to:"/posts/C++/io-multiplexing/01-tcp-socket-kernel.html"},{default:(0,e.k6)(()=>[...i[0]||(i[0]=[(0,e.eW)("TCP/字节序",-1)])]),_:1}),i[4]||(i[4]=(0,e.eW)("、",-1)),(0,e.bF)(a,{to:"/posts/C++/io-multiplexing/02-select-poll-epoll.html"},{default:(0,e.k6)(()=>[...i[1]||(i[1]=[(0,e.eW)("API",-1)])]),_:1}),i[5]||(i[5]=(0,e.eW)("、",-1)),(0,e.bF)(a,{to:"/posts/C++/io-multiplexing/03-kernel-reactor.html"},{default:(0,e.k6)(()=>[...i[2]||(i[2]=[(0,e.eW)("内核与 Reactor",-1)])]),_:1}),i[6]||(i[6]=(0,e.eW)(" 的模型。本篇把它们放到可编译程序中逐项观察。",-1))]),(0,e.Q3)(" more "),i[8]||(i[8]=(0,e.Fv)('<h2 id="_1-源代码与运行边界" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-源代码与运行边界"><span>1. 源代码与运行边界</span></a></h2><p>配套完整源码保存在本博客 GitHub 仓库的 <a href="https://github.com/ageni01/ageno-block/tree/main/examples/io-multiplexing" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">examples/io-multiplexing</a>：</p><ul><li><code>echo_server.c</code>：C11，多连接、非阻塞读写、有界输出缓冲；命令行切换 select/poll/epoll。</li><li><code>client.cpp</code>：C++17，RAII fd、循环发送、半关闭、精确校验回显。</li><li><code>frame_decoder.cpp</code>：长度前缀解析器，验证半包、连续多帧、二进制和大小限制。</li></ul><p>select/poll 部分适用于本示例使用的 POSIX 环境；epoll 分支只有 Linux 编译。示例不是 Windows Winsock 代码。本机 macOS 已编译并验证 select/poll 与 C++ 客户端；当前没有可用 Linux Docker 守护进程，因此 epoll 分支尚未完成 Linux 编译运行验证，不能把前两种通过当作第三种也已通过。</p><h2 id="_2-编译与第一次通信" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-编译与第一次通信"><span>2. 编译与第一次通信</span></a></h2><p>克隆仓库后进入 examples/io-multiplexing：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="bash" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-bash"><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#4078F2;--shiki-dark:#61AFEF;">cc</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> -std=c11</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> -O2</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> -Wall</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> -Wextra</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> -Werror</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> echo_server.c</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> -o</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> /tmp/echo-server</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#4078F2;--shiki-dark:#61AFEF;">c++</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> -std=c++17</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> -O2</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> -Wall</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> -Wextra</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> -Werror</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> client.cpp</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> -o</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> /tmp/echo-client</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#4078F2;--shiki-dark:#61AFEF;">c++</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> -std=c++17</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> -O2</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> -Wall</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> -Wextra</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> -Werror</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> frame_decoder.cpp</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> -o</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> /tmp/frame-decoder</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#4078F2;--shiki-dark:#61AFEF;">/tmp/frame-decoder</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#4078F2;--shiki-dark:#61AFEF;">/tmp/echo-server</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> select</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>另一终端运行：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="bash" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-bash"><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#4078F2;--shiki-dark:#61AFEF;">/tmp/echo-client</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> &#39;hello ageno&#39;</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>客户端应输出同样的 hello ageno，服务端记录新连接 fd 和 peer IP:端口。服务端 Ctrl+C 后换成 <code>/tmp/echo-server poll</code> 再试；Linux 上再运行 <code>/tmp/echo-server epoll</code>。</p><p>服务端绑定 127.0.0.1:9090，仅本机访问。若 A/B 是两台机器，B 需要绑定可达接口地址，A 将 inet_pton 中的目标改为 B 的地址；同时检查路由、防火墙、容器映射。不要把 localhost 当成远程服务器地址。</p><h2 id="_3-c-程序中的网络生命周期" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-c-程序中的网络生命周期"><span>3. C 程序中的网络生命周期</span></a></h2><p>main 依次做：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="text" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-text"><span class="line"><span>忽略 SIGPIPE → 初始化连接槽 → socket → SO_REUSEADDR</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>  → 填 sockaddr_in → htons(9090) → inet_pton</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>  → bind → listen → 设置监听 fd 非阻塞</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>  → 按 mode 进入 select/poll/epoll 循环</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>SO_REUSEADDR 不是“任意多个进程都能抢同一监听地址”的万能开关，与 SO_REUSEPORT 也不是同一选项。操作失败要检查 errno，不要靠反复加选项掩盖端口占用。</p><p>accept_all 一直 accept 到 EAGAIN，每个新 fd 显式设非阻塞，保存到连接槽。select 模式还拒绝 fd &gt;= FD_SETSIZE，避免越界。连接槽满时关闭新连接，作为明确的简化过载策略。</p><h2 id="_4-连接状态必须保存什么" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_4-连接状态必须保存什么"><span>4. 连接状态必须保存什么</span></a></h2><p>源码的每个 client 保存：</p><div class="language-c line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="c" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-c"><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;">struct</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;"> client {</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;">    int</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;"> fd, eof;</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;">    size_t</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;"> off, len;</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;">    unsigned</span><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;"> char</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E45649;--shiki-dark:#E06C75;"> out</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">[</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;">65536</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">];</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">};</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>有效待发字节是 out[off..len)。eof 表示已确认对端发送方向结束，不代表可以立即丢掉待发响应。64KiB 是实验上限，最多 128 连接，静态总缓冲约 8MiB。</p><h3 id="_4-1-读入" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_4-1-读入"><span>4.1 读入</span></a></h3><p>如果前面已发送一部分，先把剩余输出紧凑搬到缓冲起点，再 recv 到剩余空间。每次正返回都增加 len；EINTR 重试，EAGAIN 暂停，0 标记 eof，其他错误关闭连接。</p><p>echo 服务不解析业务帧，因为它的协议就是原样回显所有字节。真正业务应把接收数据追加到独立输入缓冲，再调用 Decoder；输出缓冲不能兼作任意复杂业务解析的全部状态。</p><h3 id="_4-2-发送" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_4-2-发送"><span>4.2 发送</span></a></h3><p>从 out+off 继续 send，正返回推进 off，EAGAIN 保留偏移，全部发送后把 off/len 归零。eof 且待发为空才关闭。这支持客户端先 shutdown(SHUT_WR)，然后继续接收服务端回显。</p><h3 id="_4-3-关注事件" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_4-3-关注事件"><span>4.3 关注事件</span></a></h3><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="text" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-text"><span class="line"><span>未 EOF 且有缓冲空间 → 关注 IN</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>存在待发送字节       → 关注 OUT</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>EOF 且输出排空        → 清理连接</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>这个状态机与等待 API 分离，所以三种后端能够复用同一个 service 函数。epoll 模式用 MOD 更新；select 模式每轮重建集合；poll 模式每轮构建 pollfd 数组。</p><p>示例 epoll 使用 LT，未开启 EPOLLET。不要只加 ET 标志就宣称实现成熟 ET：满缓冲后暂不 drain、恢复读与公平性等状态需要重新设计与验证。</p><h2 id="_5-为什么-c-客户端还要循环-send" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_5-为什么-c-客户端还要循环-send"><span>5. 为什么 C++ 客户端还要循环 send</span></a></h2><p>C++ 没有另一套内核 TCP 协议，它仍调用同样的 POSIX socket API。主要区别是用类封装生命周期：</p><div class="language-cpp line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="cpp" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-cpp"><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;">class</span><span style="--shiki-light:#C18401;--shiki-dark:#E5C07B;"> Fd</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;"> {</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;">    int</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;"> value_;</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;">public:</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;">    explicit</span><span style="--shiki-light:#4078F2;--shiki-dark:#61AFEF;"> Fd</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">(</span><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;">int</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#E06C75;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic;"> value</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">);</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#4078F2;--shiki-dark:#61AFEF;">    ~Fd</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">();</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#4078F2;--shiki-dark:#61AFEF;">    Fd</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">(</span><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;">const</span><span style="--shiki-light:#C18401;--shiki-dark:#E5C07B;"> Fd</span><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;">&amp;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">) </span><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;">=</span><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;"> delete</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">;</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#C18401;--shiki-dark:#E5C07B;">    Fd</span><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;">&amp;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;"> operator</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">=(</span><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;">const</span><span style="--shiki-light:#C18401;--shiki-dark:#E5C07B;"> Fd</span><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;">&amp;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">) </span><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;">=</span><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;"> delete</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">;</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#4078F2;--shiki-dark:#61AFEF;">    Fd</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">(</span><span style="--shiki-light:#C18401;--shiki-dark:#E5C07B;">Fd</span><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;">&amp;&amp;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#E06C75;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic;"> other</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">) </span><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;">noexcept</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">;</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;">    int</span><span style="--shiki-light:#4078F2;--shiki-dark:#61AFEF;"> get</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">() </span><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;">const</span><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;"> noexcept</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">;</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">};</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>禁止复制避免两个对象误 close 同一 fd，移动转移所有权。异常退出时析构函数仍释放已拥有的 fd。不要在析构里抛异常，也不要随意“失败后重试 close”而忽略 fd 可能复用的风险。</p><p>客户端为了突出 Socket 生命周期使用阻塞 connect/send/recv；这不妨碍它与非阻塞多路复用服务端通信。客户端也可以设计成事件驱动，但需要额外连接中、发送中、接收中的状态。</p><h2 id="_6-给-tcp-字节流加长度前缀" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_6-给-tcp-字节流加长度前缀"><span>6. 给 TCP 字节流加长度前缀</span></a></h2><p>frame_decoder.cpp 的协议：4 字节大端长度 + payload，最大 1MiB。一个 Decoder 对象对应一条连接，feed 接收每次 recv 的字节片段。</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="text" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-text"><span class="line"><span>feed(前2字节) → 不足头部，保留</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>feed(后2字节 + he) → 头部完整，body不足，保留</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>feed(llo + 下一帧...) → 产出 hello，再继续解析下一帧</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>解析器使用 memcpy 读 uint32_t，再 ntohl，而非把 char* 强制转换为 uint32_t* 直接读。它允许 payload 内含 &#39;\\0&#39;，不使用 strlen。为简化内存边界，feed 约定一次不超过 4096 字节；接入网络时对应使用 4096 大小的 recv 缓冲。</p><p>调用示意（片段）：</p><div class="language-cpp line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="cpp" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-cpp"><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;">unsigned</span><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;"> char</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E45649;--shiki-dark:#E5C07B;"> buf</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">[</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;">4096</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">];</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;">ssize_t</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;"> n </span><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;">=</span><span style="--shiki-light:#4078F2;--shiki-dark:#61AFEF;"> recv</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">(fd, buf, sizeof buf, </span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;">0</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">);</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;">if</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;"> (n </span><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;">&gt;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> 0</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">) {</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#E45649;--shiki-dark:#E5C07B;">    decoder</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">.</span><span style="--shiki-light:#4078F2;--shiki-dark:#61AFEF;">feed</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">(buf, </span><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">static_cast</span><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;">&lt;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">std::</span><span style="--shiki-light:#A626A4;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;">size_t&gt;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">(n), [](std::</span><span style="--shiki-light:#C18401;--shiki-dark:#E5C07B;">string</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#E06C75;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic;"> payload</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">) {</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#A0A1A7;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#7F848E;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic;">        // 这里才得到完整应用消息，可继续解析 JSON/命令。</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">    });</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">}</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>网络 EOF 时如果 decoder.complete() 为 false，说明流结束在半帧位置，应按协议错误处理，而不是当成完整消息。示例解析器出错后应放弃连接，不继续复用其状态。</p><h2 id="_7-抓包-把四元组和系统调用对起来" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_7-抓包-把四元组和系统调用对起来"><span>7. 抓包：把四元组和系统调用对起来</span></a></h2><p>Linux 服务端运行时，另一终端观察：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="bash" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-bash"><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#4078F2;--shiki-dark:#61AFEF;">ss</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> -ltnp</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> &#39;sport = :9090&#39;</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#4078F2;--shiki-dark:#61AFEF;">ss</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> -tnp</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> &#39;( sport = :9090 or dport = :9090 )&#39;</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>第一条看监听，第二条看连接。客户端默认很快结束，要观察 ESTABLISHED，可用另一个终端交互连接：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="bash" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-bash"><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#4078F2;--shiki-dark:#61AFEF;">nc</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> 127.0.0.1</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> 9090</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>输入一行看到回显，暂时不要退出。不同 nc 实现的退出/半关闭参数不同，不要依赖所有平台都有同一个 -N/-q 行为。</p><p>抓包需要系统允许的权限：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="bash" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-bash"><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#A0A1A7;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#7F848E;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic;"># Linux loopback；macOS 将 lo 改为 lo0</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#4078F2;--shiki-dark:#61AFEF;">sudo</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> tcpdump</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> -i</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> lo</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> -nn</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> &#39;tcp port 9090&#39;</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>观察源/目的地址和端口，SYN、SYN+ACK、ACK，数据与关闭。loopback 可能受抓包点、卸载和显示方式影响，不要把展示出来的每条记录当成“应用的一次 send”。NAT 和远程机器测试应选择正确接口，并在两端分别抓包对照。</p><h2 id="_8-系统调用追踪-确认-epoll-不读业务内容" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_8-系统调用追踪-确认-epoll-不读业务内容"><span>8. 系统调用追踪：确认 epoll 不读业务内容</span></a></h2><p>Linux 可使用：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="bash" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-bash"><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#4078F2;--shiki-dark:#61AFEF;">strace</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> -f</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> -tt</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> -e</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> trace=network,epoll_create1,epoll_ctl,epoll_wait,select,pselect6,poll,ppoll,fcntl,close</span><span style="--shiki-light:#0184BC;--shiki-dark:#56B6C2;"> \\</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;">  /tmp/echo-server</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> epoll</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>不同 libc 可能将用户函数转换为 pselect6 等底层系统调用；跟踪输出也随架构变化。macOS 不提供 strace，不能照抄此命令。</p><p>尝试把日志按时间连成：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="text" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-text"><span class="line"><span>epoll_create1 → ADD listener → wait</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>客户端 connect → listener IN</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>accept → 得到 connfd → 设置非阻塞 → ADD connfd</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>wait → connfd IN</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>recv → 有效字节 → EAGAIN/EOF</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>send → 部分/全部 → 必要时 MOD OUT</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>DEL/close</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>有时候 accept 返回的连接已经有数据，ADD 之后很快就绪；不必假设每个步骤都严格对应一次独立 wait。查看 EAGAIN 是正确事件循环的正常结束条件，不是必然出错。</p><h2 id="_9-几个最有帮助的实验" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_9-几个最有帮助的实验"><span>9. 几个最有帮助的实验</span></a></h2><ol><li>连接后不输入，同时再开第二客户端：多路复用服务仍能处理第二个。</li><li>发送超过 64KiB 的二进制，并同时接收：验证缓冲满后恢复和部分读写。</li><li>多客户端并发：观察不同 connfd 与不同四元组。</li><li>半关闭写方向：观察服务器仍排空回显，再关闭连接。</li><li>断开客户端：区分有序 EOF 与 reset 等错误。</li><li>将 echo 改为长度帧：分多次发送同一头部，再把多帧合成一次发送。</li><li>Linux 改 LT 为 ET 时故意只 recv 一次：观察剩余数据为何可能停住，然后按 ET 状态规则修复。</li></ol><p>当客户端单线程先 send 巨量数据、直到发完才 recv 时，双方有界缓冲可能形成相互等待；测试大数据应并行发送和接收，或设计合适的请求/响应协议。不能看到这种测试死锁就直接断言 poll 或 epoll 失效。</p><h2 id="_10-验证记录与下一步" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_10-验证记录与下一步"><span>10. 验证记录与下一步</span></a></h2><p>本次 macOS 验证：C11/C++17 严格告警编译，select/poll 分别运行 C++ 回显客户端；8 并发连接、每连接 1MiB 二进制、分片发送和写半关闭；帧解析器验证多种切分长度、合并帧、包含零字节与超长拒绝。Linux epoll 尚未实测。</p><p>生产还需要连接/空闲超时、总内存上限、EMFILE 等过载退避、信号退出、TLS、安全策略、连接 ID 生命周期、性能测量与长期测试。把这些逐步加到状态机，远比只背三个函数名更能理解网络服务器。</p><p>参考：<a href="https://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man2/recv.2.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">recv</a>、<a href="https://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man2/send.2.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">send</a>、<a href="https://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man7/epoll.7.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">epoll</a>。</p>',64))])}]]),h=JSON.parse('{"path":"/posts/C__/io-multiplexing/04-c-cpp-lab.html","title":"C/C++ Socket 实战：同一服务切换 select、poll、epoll，配合抓包理解全过程","lang":"zh-CN","frontmatter":{"title":"C/C++ Socket 实战：同一服务切换 select、poll、epoll，配合抓包理解全过程","date":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z","category":["C++"],"tag":["C","C++","Socket","I/O 多路复用"]},"git":{"createdTime":1793362182000,"updatedTime":1793362182000,"contributors":[{"name":"Yasuoa吖","username":"","email":"2519529119@qq.com","commits":1}]},"readingTime":{"minutes":8.02,"words":2405},"filePathRelative":"posts/C++/io-multiplexing/04-c-cpp-lab.md","excerpt":"\\n<p>前面三篇分别建立 <a href=\\"/ageno-block/posts/C++/io-multiplexing/01-tcp-socket-kernel.html\\" target=\\"_blank\\">TCP/字节序</a>、<a href=\\"/ageno-block/posts/C++/io-multiplexing/02-select-poll-epoll.html\\" target=\\"_blank\\">API</a>、<a href=\\"/ageno-block/posts/C++/io-multiplexing/03-kernel-reactor.html\\" target=\\"_blank\\">内核与 Reactor</a> 的模型。本篇把它们放到可编译程序中逐项观察。</p>\\n"}')},6262(s,i){i.A=(s,i)=>{const a=s.__vccOpts||s;for(const[s,e]of i)a[s]=e;return a}}}]);